{"id":"657926","name":"酱香饼","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/657926/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"洋葱","amount":"1小块"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"2瓣"},{"name":"小葱","amount":"2根"},{"name":"白熟芝麻","amount":"3g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉。","img":"images/657926/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入50克热水，50克凉水。","img":"images/657926/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"和成面团，醒发半个小时。","img":"images/657926/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"碗内舀一勺面粉，加入油，调成油酥。","img":"images/657926/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"洋葱和蒜搅成粒。","img":"images/657926/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"碗内放入豆瓣酱、黄豆酱、番茄酱、蚝油、五香粉、糖、鸡精，再加小半碗清水搅拌。","img":"images/657926/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"所有配料准备好，油酥、酱汁、葱蒜粒、小葱、白芝麻。","img":"images/657926/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"热油，炒香葱蒜粒。","img":"images/657926/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入酱汁煮开。","img":"images/657926/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盛入碗内备用。","img":"images/657926/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"面醒发好了取出。","img":"images/657926/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"擀成一张大饼。","img":"images/657926/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"抹上油酥，用刀把面片划开。","img":"images/657926/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"再层层包裹起来。","img":"images/657926/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"包成一个面团，收口处捏紧。","img":"images/657926/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"继续擀面。","img":"images/657926/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"再次擀成一张大薄饼。","img":"images/657926/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"平底锅热油，放入面饼，推出褶皱，表面再喷上油。","img":"images/657926/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"两面煎熟。","img":"images/657926/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"刷上酱汁。","img":"images/657926/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"撒入葱花和白芝麻即可。","img":"images/657926/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"放凉后切块。","img":"images/657926/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"成品。又酥又香。","img":"images/657926/step_23.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}